// A done job past 48 drops even when the directory is longer.
// A queued job stays. The ranker is unchanged.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE scan ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG scan law

IMPULSE scan 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "scan" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
